# A minimal Snake brain: a baseline that proves the sense->act loop works.
# The harness writes `food` each tick (a bump pointing toward the food) and
# reads where `motor` activity concentrates to pick a move. This law simply
# lets the food signal soak into a diffusing motor field, so the motor's centre
# of mass sits toward the food and the snake heads that way. Not clever — a
# floor for LLM-written or evolved brains to beat.

channel food
channel motor: init 0

rule think:
  when 1
  set motor = 0.6 * avg8(motor) + food
